# English-only Picsou reports

Jury-visible and GitHub-visible report surfaces are **English only**.

## Surfaces

- Generated Cursor canvases (`picsou-*.canvas.tsx`)
- Canvas generator chrome / HELP copy in `scripts/render-canvas-report.mjs`
- Matrix recommendation text / why strings emitted by `src/matrix.mjs`
- Demo docs under `docs/demo/` that describe how to read reports

## Rules

1. Do not add French (or other non-English) UI chrome, callouts, chart labels, table headers, or HELP tooltips to report canvases.
2. Do not restore a report-level “Infobulles” / legend banner. Optional `i` tips may pin locally only.
3. Private chat may follow the user’s language; report artifacts stay English.
4. Keep `test/canvas-english.test.mjs` green — it fails the suite if French markers reappear in the renderer.

## When editing the canvas renderer

Translate or rewrite in English first. Run `npm test` and `npm run canvas:report` before shipping.
